{"availability":"available","full":"ZyntariHQ/Invoisio","name":"Invoisio","description":"Invoisio is a blockchain-powered invoicing tool for freelancers on Base. AI securely reads wallet activity to auto-generate invoices, and privacy-preserving verification lets clients confirm and pay in ETH or USDC—without exposing your full transaction history.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":8,"forks":138,"created":"2025-09-12T16:10:51Z","updated":"2026-08-30T16:34:11Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://invoisio-roan.vercel.app/","topics":[],"demo":"https://invoisio-roan.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:52.478Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:52.478Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:52.478Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T17:54:52.478Z","stars":8,"forks":138}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Invoisio is a modern, privacy‑first invoice platform. It combines AI‑assisted invoice creation with fast, low‑cost crypto payments on the Stellar network. Payments are sent directly to merchant accounts using Stellar's native Payment operation. Optional memos (text or hash) carry the invoice identifier for reliable off‑chain matching and reconciliation.","Invoisio is being adapted to run with grant programs on GrantFox (grantfox.xyz) so contributors can help fund and use the app in real projects."],"features":["AI‑assisted invoice creation with clean, responsive UI","Wallet‑based authentication (Freighter, Lobstr, Albedo, etc.); no passwords","Invoice detail page with SEP-0007 payment links (web)","Live status updates via intelligent polling with exponential backoff","Ultra‑low‑cost payments on Stellar: XLM and USDC"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ZyntariHQ/Invoisio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0010bee18d6b00b756155b137122fd7452e1d88ed4b720ac5dbd88fb664600ba","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:55.953Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:54:55.953Z","projectIns